  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financing Program for Productive, Inclusive and Sustainable Rural Development</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de financiamiento para el desarrollo rural productivo, inclusivo y sustentable</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">General objective of the CCLIP and the first program: The general objective is to help raise agricultural productivity, increase rural financial inclusion, improve environmental sustainability, and enhance climate resilience. Specific objective of the first program: The specific objective of the first program is to improve access to financing for rural economic units (REUs), particularly small and medium-sized units and those with investments in environmental sustainability projects.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Objetivo general de la CCLIP y del primer programa: El objetivo general es contribuir a elevar la productividad del sector agropecuario, la inclusin financiera rural y la sustentabilidad ambiental y resiliencia climtica. Objetivo especfico del primer programa: El objetivo especfico es un mayor acceso a financiamiento para las Unidades Econmicas Rurales (UER), en particular pequeas y medianas y aquellas con inversiones en proyectos de sustentabilidad ambiental.</narrative>
  </description>
